#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
IRAM OS Sovereign Appearance & Rice Tuner GUI
=============================================
Unified visual control center inspired by Omarchy 4.5.
Controls:
1. Window Geometry & Brutalism (Rounding 0-24px, Borders 0-6px, Gaps In/Out)
2. Glassmorphism & Visual FX (Kawase blur passes/size, opacities, drop shadows, dimming)
3. Palette & Wallpaper Studio (55 curated themes, wallpaper cycling, live previews)
4. Bar & Dock Aesthetics (Waybar island styles, macOS floating dock toggle & positions)
5. Typography & Cursor (Nerd Font selector, scale, cursor themes & sizes)

Zero-restart architecture: All geometry & decoration sliders immediately dispatch
'hyprctl keyword' for instant live previews, with atomic persistence to appearance.conf.
"""

